{"4307330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ROUTE16R", "steam_appid": 4307330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5029740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route16R is a brand-new entry in the classic Route16 series, originally released in the 1980s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemy vehicles and monsters as you race through the stage, collecting every item scattered across the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch dynamically between Maze Mode, where you navigate intricate labyrinths filled with traps and gimmicks, and Radar Mode, which reveals the entire stage made up of 16 mazes-delivering a high-speed chase experience that surpasses the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Just Run - Fight Back with the Evolved MAD X-R:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike previous Route16 titles, colliding with enemies triggers a transformation: MAD X-R shifts into a combat robot, initiating battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your upgraded MAD X-R’s attacks along with SP items collected throughout the stage to deal damage and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before entering a stage, use the money you’ve recovered to customize your MAD X-R.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance core attributes like fuel and speed, as well as combat performance, to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kanharoo Gang won’t go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all items won’t end the stage-doing so will trigger a boss encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses unleash intense attacks to corner MAD X-R.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge their assaults, find openings in their defenses, and strike back by transforming into robot form to deal decisive damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mode is included for the first time in the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a mini-game where players battle to capture the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fast-paced, arcade-style chase action with friends and family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Local multiplayer only. Online multiplayer is not supported.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route16R is a brand-new entry in the classic Route16 series, originally released in the 1980s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemy vehicles and monsters as you race through the stage, collecting every item scattered across the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch dynamically between Maze Mode, where you navigate intricate labyrinths filled with traps and gimmicks, and Radar Mode, which reveals the entire stage made up of 16 mazes-delivering a high-speed chase experience that surpasses the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Just Run - Fight Back with the Evolved MAD X-R:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike previous Route16 titles, colliding with enemies triggers a transformation: MAD X-R shifts into a combat robot, initiating battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your upgraded MAD X-R’s attacks along with SP items collected throughout the stage to deal damage and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before entering a stage, use the money you’ve recovered to customize your MAD X-R.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance core attributes like fuel and speed, as well as combat performance, to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kanharoo Gang won’t go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all items won’t end the stage-doing so will trigger a boss encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses unleash intense attacks to corner MAD X-R.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge their assaults, find openings in their defenses, and strike back by transforming into robot form to deal decisive damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mode is included for the first time in the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a mini-game where players battle to capture the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fast-paced, arcade-style chase action with friends and family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Local multiplayer only. Online multiplayer is not supported.</p>", "short_description": "A brand-new entry in the classic high-octane car chase action series, Route16, originally released in the 1980s. Take down the revived Kanharoo Gang with the evolved MAD X-R!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307330/58a63a96dbcbaff8701765d3e26e1a1dce96b902/header.jpg?t=1785941326", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307330/216f6d54501c1a091812f60fa8882474474aaf82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785941326", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307330/216f6d54501c1a091812f60fa8882474474aaf82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785941326", "website": "https://sunsoft.games/route16r/top", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel® UHD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><stro